/* 模考做题页：对齐「机构模考第二做题页.html」（设计宽 480px，按 750/480≈1.5625 换算并整体放大一档） */

page { background: #F3F7FB; }

.status-pad { width: 100%; background: #FFFFFF; }

.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: #F3F7FB;
  color: #24364D;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
}

/* ---------- 顶部试卷条 ---------- */
.exambar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}
.back { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #526B84; font-size: 30rpx; line-height: 1; }
.exam-name {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: #243D5E;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.timer { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #74879D; font-size: 21rpx; }
.timer-space { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 60rpx; }

/* ---------- 模式切换 ---------- */
.mode-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14rpx;
  padding: 18rpx 24rpx 18rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}
.mode-btn {
  height: 76rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #D9E4F3;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #526B88;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.mode-on {
  border-color: #9FC2E9;
  background: #E7F0FF;
  color: #1766C2;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.progress-line { height: 8rpx; background: #E5EDF5; }
.progress-fill { height: 100%; background: #3277ED; border-radius: 0 8rpx 8rpx 0; transition: width .2s; }

/* ---------- 通用内容 ---------- */
.main { padding: 26rpx 24rpx 0; }
.summary { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12rpx; margin: 0 4rpx 20rpx; }
.summary-strong { color: #243D5E; font-size: 25rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.summary-hint { color: #8190A3; font-size: 20rpx; }

.stem { display: block; margin-top: 14rpx; color: #1C3149; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-word; }
.stem-single { font-size: 30rpx; }
.stem-image { display: block; width: 100%; margin: 14rpx 0; border-radius: 12rpx; }

.options { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 24rpx; }
.option {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 20rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}
.option-letter {
  flex: 0 0 40rpx;
  height: 40rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #EDF1F5;
  color: #718196;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.option-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; color: #40566E; font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 1.55; word-break: break-word; }
.option-on { border-color: #3277ED; background: #EDF4FF; }
.option-on .option-letter { background: #3277ED; color: #FFFFFF; }
.option-on .option-text { color: #1766C2; }

/* ---------- 滚动浏览 ---------- */
.browse-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22rpx; }
.q-card {
  padding: 28rpx 26rpx 24rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0EAF3;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 14rpx rgba(70, 104, 135, .05);
}
.q-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12rpx; }
.q-no { flex: 1; min-width: 0; color: #243D5E; font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.q-status {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 6rpx 12rpx;
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  background: #F1F4F8;
  color: #74879D;
  font-size: 19rpx;
}
.q-status-done { background: #E6F7F0; color: #17866A; }
.star { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #B8C4D2; font-size: 30rpx; line-height: 1; }
.star-on { color: #E0A83E; }

.q-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 22rpx; }
.q-tip { color: #8190A3; font-size: 20rpx; }
.board-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 18rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #C9DCF3;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #EDF4FF;
  color: #1766C2;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: normal;
}

.browse-space { height: 150rpx; }
.browse-bar {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.25fr;
  gap: 14rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 24rpx calc(20rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-top: 2rpx solid #E4EDF6;
}
.bar-btn {
  height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #40566E;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.bar-primary { border-color: #3277ED; background: #3277ED; color: #FFFFFF; }

/* ---------- 单题作答 ---------- */
.q-single {
  padding: 32rpx 28rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0EAF3;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 14rpx rgba(70, 104, 135, .05);
}
.labels { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12rpx; }
.label {
  padding: 6rpx 14rpx;
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  background: #EDF4FF;
  color: #1766C2;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.label-type { background: #F1ECFF; color: #6B4FA8; }
.source { display: block; margin-top: 18rpx; color: #8190A3; font-size: 20rpx; line-height: 1.7; }

.answer-area { margin-top: 18rpx; }
.answer-input {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 180rpx;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 22rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #FBFCFF;
  color: #20354F;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  line-height: 1.7;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.answer-draft { display: block; margin-top: 14rpx; color: #40566E; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 1.7; }
.reveal-btn {
  height: 72rpx;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #526B88;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.reveal-btn-solid { border-color: #3277ED; background: #3277ED; color: #FFFFFF; }
.verdict { display: block; margin-top: 16rpx; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.verdict-ok { color: #17866A; }
.verdict-no { color: #C0505B; }
.answer-box { margin-top: 16rpx; padding: 18rpx 20rpx; border-radius: 14rpx; background: #EAF7EF; }
.answer-caption { display: block; color: #17866A; font-size: 21rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.answer-text { display: block; margin-top: 8rpx; color: #33574A; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 1.7; }
.self-mark { display: flex; gap: 14rpx; margin-top: 16rpx; }
.self-btn {
  flex: 1;
  height: 72rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  color: #476078;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.self-btn-on { border-color: #4AB184; background: #F0FBF6; color: #246E54; }
.tip { display: block; margin-top: 12rpx; color: #5E7A93; font-size: 21rpx; }
.board-btn-wide { margin-top: 20rpx; justify-content: center; }
.board-hint { color: #7C93AC; font-size: 19rpx; font-weight: 400; }
.writing-tip { display: block; margin-top: 12rpx; color: #98A6B5; font-size: 19rpx; }

.actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14rpx; margin-top: 26rpx; }
.action-btn {
  height: 84rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #40566E;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.submit-btn {
  height: 90rpx;
  margin-top: 18rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #3277ED;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.bottom-space { height: 72rpx; }

/* ---------- 结果 ---------- */
.score-card {
  padding: 26rpx 24rpx;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E7F0FF 0%, #F5F9FF 100%);
  border: 2rpx solid #D9E4F3;
}
.score-label { color: #6784A7; font-size: 21rpx; }
.score-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8rpx; margin-top: 6rpx; }
.score-num { color: #1766C2; font-size: 56rpx; font-weight: 750; line-height: 1.1; }
.score-total { color: #6784A7; font-size: 22rpx; }
.score-acc { display: block; margin-top: 6rpx; color: #526B88; font-size: 21rpx; }

.result-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin: 24rpx 4rpx 12rpx; }
.result-title { color: #243D5E; font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.result-hint { color: #8190A3; font-size: 19rpx; }

.review {
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  padding: 26rpx 26rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0EAF3;
  border-radius: 18rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}
.review-ok { border-left: 6rpx solid #4AB184; }
.review-bad { border-left: 6rpx solid #E58E96; }
.review-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.review-no { color: #1766C2; font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.review-tag { color: #74879D; font-size: 20rpx; }
.review-stem { margin-top: 10rpx; color: #24364D; font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 1.7; }
.review-line { display: flex; gap: 12rpx; margin-top: 10rpx; }
.review-key { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #8190A3; font-size: 21rpx; }
.review-val { flex: 1; min-width: 0; color: #40566E; font-size: 21rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.review-val-right { color: #17866A; font-weight: 600; }
.review-expl { margin-top: 10rpx; padding-top: 10rpx; border-top: 2rpx solid #F0F4F9; color: #687D93; font-size: 21rpx; line-height: 1.7; }

/* ---------- 弹层通用 ---------- */
.mask {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 40;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  background: rgba(28, 44, 64, .42);
}
.sheet {
  width: 100%;
  max-height: 78vh;
  overflow: auto;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx calc(28rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-radius: 28rpx 28rpx 0 0;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.sheet-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14rpx; }
.sheet-title { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8rpx; color: #243D5E; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 750; }
.sheet-icon { color: #3277ED; font-size: 26rpx; }
.sheet-count { color: #6784A7; font-size: 21rpx; }
.sheet-close { padding: 0 8rpx; color: #7B8BA0; font-size: 40rpx; line-height: 1; }

.sheet-legend { display: flex; gap: 22rpx; margin: 16rpx 0 18rpx; }
.legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8rpx; color: #8190A3; font-size: 20rpx; }
.legend-dot { width: 18rpx; height: 18rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #E6ECF4; }
.legend-done { background: #4AB184; }
.legend-fav { background: #E0A83E; }

.sheet-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12rpx; }
.cell {
  height: 72rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0E6ED;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  color: #314760;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.cell-done { border-color: #B7DECE; background: #E8F5EE; color: #28775B; }
.cell-active { border-color: #3277ED; background: #EAF4FF; color: #1766C2; }

.sheet-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 22rpx; }
.sheet-meta { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rpx; color: #8190A3; font-size: 19rpx; }
.sheet-warning { color: #C07A45; }
.sheet-submit {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 18rpx 26rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #3277ED;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* ---------- 默写板 ---------- */
.board {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx calc(24rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-radius: 28rpx 28rpx 0 0;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.board-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.board-heading { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rpx; }
.board-title { color: #243D5E; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 750; }
.board-sub { color: #7B8BA0; font-size: 19rpx; }
.board-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10rpx; margin-top: 18rpx; }
.board-tool {
  padding: 9rpx 18rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  color: #476078;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  line-height: normal;
}
.board-tool-on { border-color: #3277ED; background: #EDF4FF; color: #1766C2; font-weight: 700; }
.board-colors { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10rpx; margin-left: auto; }
.board-color { width: 34rpx; height: 34rpx; border-radius: 50%; border: 4rpx solid transparent; }
.board-color-on { border-color: #3277ED; }
.board-canvas {
  width: 100%;
  height: 480rpx;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0EAF3;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.board-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 18rpx; }
.board-btn-plain {
  padding: 12rpx 24rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #526B88;
  font-size: 21rpx;
}
.board-saved { flex: 1; color: #98A6B5; font-size: 19rpx; }
.board-save {
  padding: 14rpx 40rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #3277ED;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* ---------- 状态 ---------- */
.state { padding: 100rpx 30rpx; text-align: center; }
.state-title { display: block; color: #405B7A; font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 650; }
.state-text { display: block; margin-top: 10rpx; color: #8190A3; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.state-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: 22rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 34rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #E7F0FF;
  color: #1766C2;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  font-weight: 650;
}
.tap-dim { opacity: .72; }
